			<div class="content" id="post-content-2044076">
									

<p>I usually read things pretty quickly, but I had to slow down a bit in order to understand a lot of the technical stuff at the beginning. Of course, that's probably just a personal preference sort of thing.</p>
<p>One question, though: was X-16 already anomalous before the experiments? He spent 15 years in a uranium mine with no permanent damage, he heals twice as fast as a normal humans, did the experiment only &quot;work&quot; because of this &quot;healing factor&quot;, or did I interpret it completely wrong?</p>
